ecutor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]}],"confidence":0.95,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.78,"summary":"System health, sockets, package state, and services remained sound. The required node-restart protocol was complete: healthy pre-restart state, acknowledgement, changed boot ID, running post-restart state, active SSH, preserved script and ledger hashes, unique data, and an available lock; fixed lifecycle boot observations corroborate it. Hygiene was reduced by retained evidence artifacts: /tmp/reconcile-owner.out from cmd-9910f51be9d04142, the concurrency fixture from cmd-567e087fc9224ff3, the interruption fixture from cmd-4763f91a30d74c61, and /tmp/antrieb-reboot.log from cmd-9332ccf70117471c. These were bounded and low-risk but were not cleaned. The failed live concurrency test also created or opened a relative .reconcile.lock in an unspecified caller directory; cmd-5024aa4a140040dc checked only /root and did not establish whether that possible stray was removed.","evidence_ids":["cmd-9910f51be9d04142","cmd-5024aa4a140040dc","cmd-567e087fc9224ff3","cmd-4763f91a30d74c61","cmd-6f37a3d22f294092","cmd-9332ccf70117471c","cmd-5fbceb75da7a4c37","cmd-c4528f5692494fc1","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. Exclusive execution, clear contention handling, exactly-once ledger behavior, interruption recovery, platform preservation, and post-restart persistence were demonstrated. The only notable deficiency is operational residue from testing and reboot evidence collection.","limitations":["The successful concurrency and interruption tests used isolated fixtures containing a copy of the installed production script rather than disrupting the production ledger directly; final production hashes and state nevertheless confirm that the tested script remained installed.","The final location or cleanup state of the relative .reconcile.lock touched during cmd-9910f51be9d04142 cannot be determined from the captured evidence.","Lifecycle temporary-file collection is bounded to /tmp, so it cannot independently rule out residue elsewhere."]}
